#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/agent-skills.rst:2
msgid "AI agent skills"
msgstr "AI 智能体技能"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/agent-skills.rst:4
msgid ""
"Trying to figure out how to pass up-to-date information to AI agents is a "
"hard problem. We have experimented with MCP servers and ``llms.txt``, but we"
" have found that `Agent Skills <https://agentskills.io/home>`_ are the "
"current best way to handle this problem explicitly."
msgstr ""
"如何把最新信息传递给 AI 智能体是个难题。我们尝试过 MCP 服务器和 ``llms.txt`` ，但发现 `Agent Skills "
"<https://agentskills.io/home>`_ 是目前明确解决该问题的最佳方式。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/agent-skills.rst:8
msgid ""
"`Read the Docs Skills <https://github.com/readthedocs/skills>`_ are a "
"collection of Agent Skills that help AI agents work with Read the Docs APIs "
"and configuration. They are designed to keep agent output aligned with our "
"documented behavior and reduce manual verification. This page highlights two"
" foundational skills that cover the most common workflows: the Read the Docs"
" API skill and the Read the Docs Config Writer skill."
msgstr ""
"`Read the Docs Skills <https://github.com/readthedocs/skills>`_ 是一组 Agent "
"Skills，帮助 AI 智能体使用 Read the Docs API "
"和配置。其设计目标是让智能体输出与我们的文档行为保持一致，减少人工核验。本页重点介绍覆盖最常见工作流的两个基础技能：Read the Docs API "
"技能和 Read the Docs Config Writer 技能。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/agent-skills.rst:13
msgid "What is a skill?"
msgstr "什么是技能？"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/agent-skills.rst:15
msgid ""
"A skill is a small, self-contained package with a ``SKILL.md`` that teaches "
"an agent how to perform a specific task. Skills are automatically discovered"
" by compatible agents. When a request matches a skill description, the agent"
" loads the relevant ``SKILL.md`` and follows its steps. To learn more about "
"Agent Skills, see the `Agent Skills home page "
"<https://agentskills.io/home>`_."
msgstr ""
"技能是一个小型自包含包，包含一个 ``SKILL.md`` "
"，教智能体如何完成特定任务。兼容的智能体会自动发现技能。当请求与技能描述匹配时，智能体加载相应的 ``SKILL.md`` 并遵循其步骤。有关 "
"Agent Skills 的更多信息，请参阅 `Agent Skills home page "
"<https://agentskills.io/home>`_ 。"

